    <tags>duster clean optimize disk system memory cli admin windows-native</tags>
    <summary>Duster (du) - Native Windows CLI Deep Cleaner &amp; Optimizer</summary>
    <description>
      Duster is an advanced, Windows-native command-line cleaning and performance optimization tool.
      It safely cleans temporary folders, Windows Update cache, Prefetch directories, and browser databases.
      It also offers live performance optimization such as system SSD TRIM execution and DNS flushing.
    </description>
